SMSHub App Icon — Placeholder Description
==========================================

Design: A rounded rectangle (iOS style) / adaptive circle (Android) with:
- Background: Dark gradient from #030712 (gray-950) to #111827 (gray-900)
- Foreground: A chat/message bubble icon in #2563eb (blue-600)
  - Single speech bubble, rounded corners
  - Three small dots inside (typing indicator style)
  - Subtle drop shadow for depth
- Size: 1024x1024 PNG (will be scaled down)

To generate the actual icon:
1. Use Figma, Sketch, or any SVG editor
2. Export at 1024x1024 PNG
3. Save as mobile/assets/icon.png (replacing this file)
4. For Android adaptive icon, also export the foreground layer separately
   as mobile/assets/adaptive-icon.png (with transparent background, centered in safe zone)

Color reference:
- Primary Blue: #2563eb
- Light Blue accent: #60a5fa
- Dark background: #030712
